<title>USA: Littlefield, Adams, Hershey in license pact.</title>
<headline>Littlefield, Adams, Hershey in license pact.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Littlefield, Adams &amp; Co said on Thursday that is has a license agreement with Hershey Foods Corp to use the Hershey's, Hershey's Kisses, Hershey's Hugs, Reese's, Amazin' Fruit and I'm a Kissable Kid! trademarks in a new licensed apparel line.</p>
<p>Littlefield said sales of the line will begin in the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>The agreement runs through November 14, 1998, it said.</p>
